Annotates 6 additional methods called from the per-tick critical path:
- onClimbable: read self position + block, write lastClimbablePos
- tickDeath: write deathTime/broadcastedDeath, may trigger entity removal
- onChangedBlock: enchantment effects (Frost Walker etc.) — block update
- removeFrost / tryAddFrost: powder snow attribute modifier on self
- rideTick: super.rideTick + resetFallDistance — self position/velocity

Total annotated methods: 45 (up from 39 in previous batch).

